    <briefdescription>
<para>No-op audit log — silently discards all events. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Use in unit tests or builds where compliance audit logging is not needed. All lifecycle hooks are no-ops; <ref refid="classthemis_1_1core_1_1concerns_1_1_no_op_audit_log_1a3f6dedf3ec9beb8594a37f8e07538391" kindref="member">isHealthy()</ref> always returns healthy. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
